  m_text: "This <b>Spatial Panel</b> provides four examples of Networked UI elements.\n\nIt
    features a spatial handle, located at the bottom of the frame, which utilizes
    a Network Grab Interactable component to enable world-space manipulation. \n\nThe
    automatic rotation is handled by a Network Billboard component, which aligns
    the panel to face the player who is currently grabbing the spatial handle."
